OL,3,GNEWSAHomes could be approved despite
OL,4,Afears over bridge
OL,5,
OL,6,FNearly 400 homes planned for farmland
OL,7,Fin a town's suburb have been
OL,8,Frecommended for approval despite
OL,9,Fconcerns a required railway bridge will
OL,10,Fnot be built.
OL,12,FPersimmon Homes wants to construct the
OL,13,F380 properties on land off Westfield
OL,14,FRoad in Dereham, Norfolk and it already
OL,15,Fhas outline permission for them.
OL,17,FA new bridge over the railway that
OL,18,Fwould support two-way traffic was a key
OL,19,Frequirement in the original permission,
OL,20,Fbut neighbouring parish councillors
OL,21,Fworry little progress has been made to
OL,22,Fprepare for its construction.
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
